  \begin{itemize}
    \item Human Life-Table Database: \texttt{albania\_lifetables\_HLD\_1950\_2011.csv} (\textbf{reale}).
    \item README i të dhënave: \texttt{mortality\_table\_synthetic.csv}, \texttt{lapse\_policies\_synthetic.csv},
      \texttt{stock\_prices\_gbm\_synthetic.csv} (\textbf{sintetike}).
